## 1. Executive Summary

Study Ops is an **ambitious, AI-heavy, full-stack personal study platform** targeting shift workers preparing for Nepal government service (Loksewa) exams, ARFF professionals, and university students. The spec is remarkably detailed — it defines 17 feature modules, 22 database tables, a 34-step build order, a multi-provider AI fallback chain, OpenMAIC integration, bilingual support, and a complete folder structure.

