| **Clarity** | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ | Exceptionally well-written. Every feature has behaviour, DB schema, and code samples. |
| **Completeness** | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ | Covers auth, DB, AI, UI, deployment, env vars, and build order. Ready to code from. |
